{"step_index":7342,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-24T15:18:10Z","thinking":"The application launched with a specified user data directory, and unexpectedly triggered a Google Sign In prompt. Investigation now focuses on determining if existing profile data, specifically from a session data file, contains the necessary Google cookies that would explain this behavior. The session data file was inspected and confirmed to include the required Google authentication cookies, suggesting a profile conflict or improper cookie handling.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Test injecting cookies from session_data.json","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import asyncio\nimport json\nfrom playwright.async_api import async_playwright\n\nasync def test_cookies():\n    with open(r\"D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX\\session_data.json\", \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        data = json.load(f)\n\n    cookies_dict = data.get(\"cookies\", {})\n    \n    # Format cookies for Playwright\n    # Playwright cookies: list of dicts with name, value, domain, path\n    google_cookies = []\n    google_domains = [\".google.com\", \"aistudio.google.com\", \"accounts.google.com\"]\n    \n    for name, value in cookies_dict.items():\n        if any(k in name.lower() for k in [\"sid\", \"hsid\", \"ssid\", \"apisid\", \"sapisid\", \"nid\", \"gaps\", \"account_chooser\"]):\n            # Add for .google.com\n            google_cookies.append({\n                \"name\": name,\n                \"value\": str(value),\n                \"domain\": \".google.com\",\n                \"path\": \"/\"\n            })\n\n    print(f\"Loaded {len(google_cookies)} Google auth cookies.\")\n\n    p = await async_playwright().start()\n    ctx = await p.chromium.launch_persistent_context(\n        user_data_dir=r\"D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio\\chrome_profile\",\n        headless=False,\n        args=[\"--disable-blink-features=AutomationControlled\", \"--start-maximized\"]\n    )\n    \n    await ctx.add_cookies(google_cookies)\n    page = ctx.pages[0] if ctx.pages else await ctx.new_page()\n    \n    await page.goto(\"https://aistudio.google.com/prompts/new_chat\", wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\")\n    await asyncio.sleep(4)\n    \n    print(\"Page URL:\", page.url)\n    print(\"Page Title:\", await page.title())\n    \n    is_signed_in = \"accounts.google.com\" not in page.url and \"Sign in\" not in (await page.title())\n    print(\"Signed in to AI Studio?:\", is_signed_in)\n    \n    await ctx.close()\n    await p.stop()\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    asyncio.run(test_cookies())\n","Description":"Test injecting Google cookies into Playwright context","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\kakak\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\scratch\\test_inject_cookies.py","toolAction":"Writing test_inject_cookies.py","toolSummary":"Create test_inject_cookies.py"}}]}
